  "title": "Equitable Announces Acquisition of Stifel Independent Advisors",
  "summary": "New York – October 27, 2025 – Equitable, a leading financial services organization and principal franchise of Equitable Holdings, Inc. (NYSE: EQH), announced today that its affiliate has entered into an agreement to acquire Stifel Independent Advisors, LLC. The transaction is expected to close in the first quarter of 2026, subject to required regulatory approvals and other customary closing conditions.",
